orbitra-lavaland-track-note = Survey log. Watch the basalt after an ash front: old Ripley prints stay visible for just a few minutes. A red cable runs to a power cabinet, and two narrow grooves mark a stretcher trail. Anything you find can be picked up on a later trip.

ent-OrbitraLavalandHydroponicsTray = pumped hydroponics tray
    .desc = An electric pump circulates nutrient solution around the roots. Crops stop growing when the pump loses power.

orbitra-lavaland-greenhouse-shift-note = The seed crates can go on the first ferry. If you're staying for a harvest, patch the exposed plating just south of the generator in the north room. There's a coil of green LV cable beside it. The trays have water and nutrients for the first planting.
orbitra-lavaland-mine-shift-note = Left the ore processor wired to the little generator. Both tanks are dry. The outpost still has welding fuel. Bring some back, fill the generator and pull the starter before loading ore into the processor.
